Subject: [PATCH] [Wayland] Reenable WaylandWpColorManagerV1

This may be reenabled now that [1] has landed to prevent HDR rendering
when GPU acceleration is disabled.

[1] https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/6925760

